# M4.24 local patch workdir diagnosis

Date: 2026-08-28

## Failure

The first M4.24 patch was applied relative to the ChatGPT project mirror rather
than the explicit Control checkout at `/Users/daniel/Projects/TU1NZ/control-ssot`.
The following four newly created files were affected: the M4.24 contract,
schema, authorization gate and first-start controller.

## Impact

- No server command or server mutation occurred.
- No existing project-mirror source was changed.
- The Control branch did not yet contain the four files.
- Compilation failed closed because the files were absent from the expected
  checkout.

## Correction and rollback

The four files are moved directly into the explicit Control checkout using the
patch mechanism. Both locations are verified immediately afterwards. Rollback
is deletion of only the four new uncommitted Control files and this diagnosis;
no tracked baseline file or server path is a rollback target.

## Prevention

Every following patch path is explicitly rooted relative to the ChatGPT task
directory as `../../../Projects/TU1NZ/control-ssot/`, and every validation
command uses that repository as its working directory.
